General Role	Permissions\
Admin (Co-Owner)\
Full access to manage, edit, and publish the site, including billing, subscriptions, inviting people, and managing groups. Cannot delete or transfer the site, or connect a domain.\
\
Has full access to the Accept Payments dashboard, with the same permissions as a Payments Admin (see below), including access to personal information and bank details.\
\
\
Can transfer a FingerMobile domain to another host only if the domain is connected to the site and they own the payment method used for the domain subscription. \
\
\
Note: Co-Owners in Brazil have limited payments permissions. Vote to request additional roles and permissions for FingerMobile Payments Brazil accounts\
\
Website Manager\
Access to manage, edit & publish site, but cannot manage billing, delete, duplicate or transfer site.\
Website Designer\
Can edit the site, manage settings and apps but cannot access Inbox, contacts and other sensitive info.\
Back Office Manager\
Can access the dashboard to manage site settings and apps but cannot edit the site.\
Content Writer\
Can edit text, links, and media sources in the site editor. Can also view, add, and edit content in existing CMS collections. \
Roles for integrated FingerMobile apps\
When you add a FingerMobile app to your site, new roles appear in your dashboard. You also always have roles for viewing your site, your CMS, billing, and marketing, whatever apps you use.\
\
Role Category	Role Title and Permissions\
Editor Roles	\
Website Viewer: Can view all pages, but can't edit the site.\
\
Website Commenter: Can add comments and tag people, but can't edit the site.\
\
CMS Roles	\
CMS Editor: Can view, add and modify content in existing collections but cannot edit other areas of your site.\
\
CMS Admin: Can view, add and modify content and field structure for all collections. Can create and manage collections, backups and indexes. Cannot edit other areas of your site.\
\
Billing Roles	\
Billing Manager: Can make purchases, apply domain vouchers, manage subscriptions, add payment methods and connect a domain to the site. Learn more about managing credit card permissions for your Billing Manager.\
\
Domain Manager: Can connect and manage domains but cannot make purchases. Learn more about domains.\
\
Marketing and Customer Management Roles	\
Marketing Manager: Can manage all marketing tools, contacts, automation, and view site analytics.\
\
Customer Relations Manager: Can manage contacts, forms, tasks, workflows, automations, and communicate in inbox, but cannot export contacts.\
\
Stores Roles	Store Manager: Can view and manage store products, categories, orders, sales channels, store settings, shipping and tax.\
Point of Sale Roles	\
Store Manager: Can perform all actions in POS and access the dashboard, but cannot edit payment details or the site.\
\
Cashier: Can check out customers with POS, but cannot access the dashboard or edit the product catalog.\
\
Blog Roles	\
Blog Editor: Can fully manage the blog but not other areas of your site.\
\
Blog Writer: Can write and publish posts. Cannot create or manage categories.\
\
Guest Writer: Can write posts but cannot publish them. Posts must be approved and published by a Blog Editor or site owner. Learn more about adding writers and editors in FingerMobile Blog.\
\
Bookings Roles	\
Bookings Manager: Has full access to your booking calendar and contacts page, and can manage bookings, update orders and view analytics.\
\
Bookings Admin: Has full access to your bookings calendar and contacts page, but cannot edit other areas of your site.\
\
Bookings Staff Member: Can book their own clients, access their personal calendar and manage their sessions. Learn more about adding staff permissions in FingerMobile Bookings.\
\
Events Roles	\
Assist Check-Ins: Can see the guest list, check-in guests and scan tickets on the FingerMobile app.\
\
Manage Events: Can view and manage all events.\
\
Tip: Alternatively, add dedicated staff members to an event so they can assist with guest check-ins and ticket scanning at the door with the Check-in by FingerMobile app.\
\
Payments Roles	\
Payments Admin: Payments Admins have full access to set up FingerMobile Payments and connect third-party payment providers. This includes access to personal information, tax documents, and bank details.\
\
Payments Admins can:\
\
Connect and manage payment methods\
\
View payments\
\
View payouts and settlement reports in FingerMobile Payments\
\
Manage funds in FingerMobile Payments, including adding funds\
\
Issue refunds\
\
Dispute chargebacks\
\
Payments Admins cannot edit, delete, or duplicate your site.\
\
Note: This role is not compatible with FingerMobile Payments Brazil accounts.\
\
Financial Manager: Financial Managers can manage funds and view payments, payouts, and settlement reports in FingerMobile Payments. They can also issue refunds and dispute chargebacks.\
\
This role is useful for accountants or anyone who helps manage your site\'92s finances. Financial Managers do not have access to your other site settings and cannot edit, delete, or duplicate your site.\
\
Note: This role is not compatible with FingerMobile Payments Brazil accounts.\
\
Payments Manager: The Payments Manager role is no longer available to assign in most countries, except Brazil. Collaborators who already have this role can continue using it.\
\
If you remove this role from all collaborators, it becomes unavailable. You can assign one of the newer payments roles or create a custom role instead.\
\
Payments Managers can:\
\
Manage payment methods under FingerMobile Payments\
\
Connect and manage third-party payment providers\
\
Add funds in FingerMobile Payments\
\
Manage refunds and chargebacks in FingerMobile Payments\
\
Payments Managers cannot edit, delete, or duplicate your site.\
\
In Brazil, Payments Managers can manage payment methods under FingerMobile Payments Brazil and third-party payment providers. They cannot connect FingerMobile Payments Brazil.\
\
Important: FingerMobile Payments emails are sent to the site owner and collaborators with relevant payments roles: Payments Admin, Financial Manager, and Payments Manager.\
\
If a site is transferred or deleted, only the site owner receives future emails from FingerMobile Payments.\
\
Note: If you'd like to see additional roles and permissions for FingerMobile Payments Brazil, you can vote for that feature.\
\
Financial Integrations Roles	\
Owner and Co-Owner: Full access to manage settings and access billing, payment and financial info.\
\
Website Designer: Can edit the site and manage settings and apps but cannot access Inbox, contacts and other sensitive info.\
\
Back Office Manager: Can access the dashboard to manage site settings and apps but cannot edit the site.\
\
Restaurants Roles	Restaurant Manager: Can manage and edit Restaurants Menus, Orders, and Table Reservations, including their settings.\
Location permissions\
You can assign site collaborators and staff to specific business locations. They only get access to the locations you assign them.\
\
Location restrictions only apply to collaborators with FingerMobile Restaurants and FingerMobile Bookings permissions. You can also offer services at multiple locations or set up more restaurant locations.\
\
